Adjust the camera's [System:Color name=tutorial ]height and zoom[/System:Color].
[System:Color name=tutorial ]Hold [ML:icon icon=L ] and move [ML:icon icon=R3 ] left/right[/System:Color] for height;
[System:Color name=tutorial ]hold [ML:icon icon=L ] and move [ML:icon icon=R3 ] up/down[/System:Color] for zoom.

The Special gauge charges from [System:Color name=tutorial ]level 1 to 4[/System:Color].
Only the Attacker attacks at level 1;
[System:Color name=tutorial ]levels 2-4 use coordinated team Specials[/System:Color].

[System:Color name=tutorial ]When all three Party Gauge bars are full, press
[ML:icon icon=plus ][/System:Color]. Then choose a Special for each team in turn;
each one damages the enemy and its element orbs.
